NOETHER repository — Dual License
==================================

This repository contains both a manuscript (and figures, corpora, written
analyses) and source code. They are released under different licences.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
PART A — Manuscript and other written / dataset works
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Scope (non-exhaustive):
  - NOETHER_paper.tex, NOETHER_paper.bib, NOETHER_paper.pdf
  - arxiv/NOETHER_paper_arxiv.tex, arxiv/NOETHER_paper.bib
  - supplementary/S2_pwr_corpus/*.csv
  - supplementary/**/README.md, supplementary/**/*.md
  - All other .md / .tex / .bib / .csv files describing the framework,
    the corpus, or the methodology.

